<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1f6b3a">
  <title>No connection · <%= config.appName %></title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light dark; --bg: #f5f7f5; --card: #fff; --ink: #1c2420; --muted: #5b6660; --accent: #1f6b3a; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root { --bg: #0f1411; --card: #171e1a; --ink: #e7ece9; --muted: #a3ada7; --accent: #3fa36a; } }
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
      font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; padding: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; }
    .card { background: var(--card); border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px 24px; max-width: 380px; text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgb(0 0 0 / .08); }
    img { width: 96px; height: 96px; border-radius: 16px; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
    p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 20px; }
    a { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <img src="/static/images/app-192.png" alt="KDLA">
    <h1>No internet connection</h1>
    <p>The KDLA app needs internet to open cases and save your work. Nothing is stored on this phone, so client details stay safe if it is lost.</p>
    <a href="/">Try again</a>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
